"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f0c080dd-e103-4cb6-9dc1-47c41abadc80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f0c080dd-e103-4cb6-9dc1-47c41abadc80\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Vengeance</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid#Involvement\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid Basement</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>You've been a silly thing, sweetie.\n</p><p><br>\nDid I not warn you? Did I not tell you death was coming, for wife and child both? But you didn't listen - and now the love of your life is rotting in the ground.\n</p><p><br>\nI can't save her - but your babe, your sweet little babe who is the image of her... I can save him.\n</p><p><br>\nIf you're willing to pay the price.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203722\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1859/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33100/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8462/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930738/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.441      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.441      1 -total\n 56.85%   24.126      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.28%   21.339     19 Template:Trim\n 22.05%    9.357      2 Template:Uid\n 15.70%    6.663      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.56%    6.181      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.77%    5.419      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.31%    4.374      2 Template:CharLink\n 10.29%    4.369      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46978-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203722 and revision id 372453. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}